Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=10}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:59.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother, it's too\Nhard to dig here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.54,0:02:04.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course it is. This island\Nis all rocks and tree roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.48,0:02:07.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Don't bury us!\NWe're victims, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:09.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, I'll do anything\Nyou want, just let me live!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.95,0:02:12.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Luffy... no,\NI mean Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:13.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He made us do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:18.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, I have a secret\Nto share with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:20.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We didn't give a damn about going
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.09,0:02:22.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to the New World\Nwith the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:30.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The reason we joined... was so\Nwe could stab them in the back
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.07,0:02:31.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and collect their bounties
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.40,0:02:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,without them ever\Nsuspecting a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Drip! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.41,0:02:40.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what\Nthat goopy stuff is,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.15,0:02:42.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you're gonna kill him\Nif you keep that up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let my friend die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:47.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got him! Take that, bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.29,0:02:48.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:53.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh-oh. That's weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And sure, your Straw\NHat did look a little off,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it had been two years,\Nso I didn't think much of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:06.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You lied without remorse,\Nand deception is a sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One that you will be buried for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother, how goes the grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.21,0:03:13.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm digging! I'm digging!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:17.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sinners all. These poor fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:21.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gods in heaven...\Nplease, forgive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:23.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grant them peace in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.19,0:03:27.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh! Peace, yes,\Nbut not death!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.29,0:03:31.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still, it's not all\Nbad, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:33.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I did find the real Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.53,0:03:37.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you, there wasn't\Nany choice in the matter.
Comment: 0,0:03:36.37,0:03:37.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there wasn't any choice\Nin the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:39.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:43.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dark King Rayleigh was there.\NHe's as strong as Kizaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:44.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even with the Pacifistas,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:47.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we couldn't so much\Nas slow him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:49.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the Caribou\Nbrothers escaped
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.48,0:03:51.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,along with the rest\Nof their crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.35,0:03:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems they took some\Nof the fake Straw Hats
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:56.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}with them as well,\Nthough I can't imagine why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:58.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}At any rate, we captured\Nmost of the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.69,0:04:00.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}even though the real Straw\NHats heavily damaged
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.73,0:04:02.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,two of our Pacifistas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:06.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One of the units was the same\Nprototype they fought before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.40,0:04:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Its strength hasn't changed\Nin the last two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.34,0:04:12.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's bad news. For us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what\Nthey've been up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the Straw Hats are immeasurably\Nmore dangerous than before.
Comment: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,more dangerous than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.51,0:04:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell the Marines\Nin the New World
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.18,0:04:23.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that they have a new\Nthreat coming their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:24.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats have returned,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.78,0:04:27.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and they're stronger than\Nwe could've imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A pity they had\Nto take off so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.87,0:04:39.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm proud of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:43.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're tough.\NThey're gonna do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:44.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:46.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm a big fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:50.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that smile, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.48,0:04:52.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.22,0:04:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:01.77,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh? Whoa-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.77,0:05:02.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:04.27,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's\Na nice ship you got there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:06.14,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but\Nit's not exactly mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:08.64,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Or rather, I stole it after\Nmy house burned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:11.01,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?\NAnd what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:13.28,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.28,0:05:14.68,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,My name's Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:18.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It's destiny meeting you, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:19.66,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.66,0:05:22.96,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,How 'bout we team up and turn\Nthis whole world upside down?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:26.46,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? And I thought\NI drank too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:27.43,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha-ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:29.13,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno who you are\Nor what you're selling,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:30.43,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,but I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.57,0:05:35.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before then, I never\Nbelieved much in fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:40.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But maybe nothing really\Nhappens by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.01,0:05:43.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're just too blind\Nto see all the signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that hat found\Nthe right man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.62,0:05:49.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So long as it sails,\NI'll stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:50.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:53.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I want to see\Na new king before I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.11,0:05:58.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The surface is\Nalready so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.01,0:05:59.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a view!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been under before,\Nbut portholes on a submarine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.05,0:06:03.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got nothin' on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.95,0:06:06.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're sinking! Sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:09.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What if we get a leak?\NThis is freaking me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.53,0:06:12.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it feels like we're leaving\Nthe whole world behind.
Comment: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:12.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the whole world behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:13.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's eerie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.23,0:06:14.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:19.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've done this like a bajillion\Ntimes before. It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.03,0:06:21.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope. Not pooping my\Npants at all, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.57,0:06:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ocean sure is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:36.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at that! They really\Nare trees, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:42.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, I totally\Nforgot about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.59,0:06:46.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're giant mangroves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.13,0:06:47.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't tell when\Nyou're up top.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:50.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it's sure quite a sight\Nto see from down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:53.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The majesty of nature\Nis truly humbling!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, my eyes would be\Npopping out of my skull
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:57.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if I had any eyes\Nto speak of, I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.11,0:07:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares? I've seen this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.91,0:07:02.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause you got on the wrong ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:05.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Don't ruin this for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:08.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These roots, they're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:10.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They stretch all the way down\Nto the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:21.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:24.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think there's something\Nbehind that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.27,0:07:31.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Took us long enough\Nto get here, but whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:33.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was worth the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:34.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder what comes next...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:37.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, fishies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.05,0:07:39.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet I can grab 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:41.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. These look\Npretty good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:42.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:46.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:48.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you pop that bubble\Nand we all die,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you! Twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:53.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Nami, you know how\Nthe coating works, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:56.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we get some basic tips {\q2}before\Nanother idiot flips out on us?
Comment: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:56.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}before another idiot\Nflips out on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.67,0:07:58.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good point. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh gave me a manual,\Nbut I can summarize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So listen closely, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:06.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's real! I can die happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sanji!\N– Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:10.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have\Nto take us with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:12.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's flippin' out now, idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:17.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His nosebleed shot him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:20.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. It maintains\Nits shape well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:21.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd think that it would burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:24.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Especially considering the immense\Namount of water pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.16,0:08:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the coating must be exposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:27.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.33,0:08:29.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I thought we'd\Nall drown down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:31.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,never to be seen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:35.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Get outta the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right. Sea water. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.01,0:08:40.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Keep pulling!\N– Keep pulling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:55.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! What the heck happened\Nto you back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:56.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew you were weak\Nto pretty girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:58.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but this is a real liability!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:00.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That poor man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:04.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine the horrors\Nhe must have endured
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:06.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,during the past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:08.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hope he lives long enough\Nto see the mermaids
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he was so looking forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:14.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, and let's also hope\Nthey aren't quite so lovely
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:16.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that the sight of them\Nstrikes him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.41,0:09:19.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When we get there, we'll have\Nto ask for blood donations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:21.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But they won't be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:24.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope Fishmen have the same\Nkind of blood as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:27.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So {\i1}Sunny{\i0}'s coating has\Nthe same properties
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:28.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as the bubbles on Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meaning that objects or\Npeople can pass in and out,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.39,0:09:33.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,without causing it\Nany harm at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spare me the bubble-science!\NWe got a man down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.47,0:09:38.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji aside, she's not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.73,0:09:41.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We saw this all over Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.17,0:09:44.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It only stretches so far, then\Nallows an object to pass through.
Comment: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:44.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then allows an object\Nto pass through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:46.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(1460,1460,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)\t(1460,1843,\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}So the good news is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:49.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if we get attacked by any\Nnasty sea creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.08,0:09:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we can still fire\Ncannons at them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.01,0:09:52.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just like we would if\Nwe were above water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:57.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, so what would pop it?\NIs it that durable?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.65,0:09:59.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It does fine with single objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:02.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but if too many things pass\Nthrough at once, then it'll break.
Comment: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then it'll break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.23,0:10:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like, if a Sea King clamps down\Non the ship, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.03,0:10:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.03,0:10:13.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,548)}– Ah! We're so screwed!\N– Ah! We're so screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:15.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're safe. Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.77,0:10:19.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, the coating doesn't protect\Nthe ship from anything except water,
Comment: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:19.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from anything except water,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:21.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so if we crash into\Na rock or a trench,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:23.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the mast breaks,\Nor something like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:24.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then the bubble\Ncould also burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.65,0:10:27.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's not like we can just\Nbounce around down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:30.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still, as long as we take the usual\Nprecautions, we should be fine.
Comment: 0,0:10:29.45,0:10:30.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:34.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm sure Luffy will try to get\Nus all killed, but what else is new?
Comment: 0,0:10:32.66,0:10:34.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but what else is new?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we're in the clear\Nafter all. Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:41.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, in theory at least,\Nbut a lot of ships
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,try to make the trip\Nto Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:45.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And over 70% of them sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:49.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ah! We are so dead!\N– Ah! We are so dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.47,0:10:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One Gum-Gum Gatling
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:54.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I bet I can catch all\Nthe fish swimmin' out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.31,0:10:56.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah? If I cut enough\Nholes in this bubble thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:59.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet I can catch even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.05,0:11:02.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening to Nami?!\NThat's too many holes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our chances down here\Nare bad enough as it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:07.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll break your bones, then fix\Nthem, then break them again!
Comment: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then break them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:08.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hachi said he'd show us to Fishman\NIsland like it was no big deal,
Comment: 0,0:11:10.69,0:11:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,like it was no big deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.99,0:11:13.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}and now we're stuck\Nin this death bubble,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,slowly descending to our demise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:16.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:19.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lunch time! They packed\Na bunch of food for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:22.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since Sanji's sick, we should\Nhave ourselves a picnic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay! All that screaming\Nmade me hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm wasting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.51,0:11:29.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.61,0:11:32.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as Nami thinks\Nthe ship'll stay stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:35.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have to steer it\Nor anything right now, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.35,0:11:36.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.29,0:11:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll just be cruising on the sea\Ncurrent till we get further down.
Comment: 0,0:11:37.69,0:11:39.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,till we get further down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.69,0:11:40.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:43.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll have more\Nexcitement a bit later,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.26,0:11:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but for the time being, we might as\Nwell just kick back and take it easy.
Comment: 0,0:11:44.33,0:11:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we might as well just kick\Nback and take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:49.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't call\Nthis "taking it easy" exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.57,0:11:52.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but there's something you\Nguys should probably know
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before we reach Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:56.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– It's robot stuff, right?!\N– It's robot stuff, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.73,0:11:59.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got all kinds\Nof secrets, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you transform into a tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.07,0:12:03.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or wait, maybe...\Nyou've got laser guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell us, robo-bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\fs95\c&H2C3AA7&\fad(150,150)}Super {\c&H9797D4&\alpha&HFF&}Armor{\c&HC2B698&}ed {\c&HE1D672&}Me!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.98,0:12:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\fs95\c&H2C3AA7&\fad(150,150)\alpha&HFF&}Super {\c&H9797D4&\alpha&H00&\4a&H78&}Armor{\c&HC2B698&}ed {\c&HE1D672&\alpha&HFF&}Me!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:08.31,0:12:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\fs95\c&H2C3AA7&\fad(150,150)\alpha&HFF&}Super {\c&H9797D4&}Armor{\c&HC2B698&}ed {\c&HE1D672&\alpha&H00&\4a&H78&}Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:16.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, no new secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:18.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\b1}Secrets inaccessible-robo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:23.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– He... speaks... robot!\N– He... speaks... robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, I know robots are\Ncool, but listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or eat and listen if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.69,0:12:32.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like Usopp said, Hachi was\Nsupposed to show us the way
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.53,0:12:34.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to Fishman Island, himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.47,0:12:37.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}but he got hurt real bad\Nback on Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:40.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He came down here ahead of us\Nto get medical treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.27,0:12:44.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it was the same thing\Nthat happened to Duval.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.31,0:12:46.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meaning, he was\Nprotecting the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.44,0:12:48.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from anyone who came for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.81,0:12:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Things got ugly about a year ago
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.45,0:12:52.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}when the Navy found out\Nthe ship was docked there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.95,0:12:56.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Both him and Duval got\Ntaken out in a big fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:59.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, a year?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then who was protecting\Nthe Sunny after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:04.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We had one more secret ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.63,0:13:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If not Rayleigh, then who?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.03,0:13:11.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone who separated us two\Nyears ago, for better or worse.
Comment: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:11.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for better or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.14,0:13:12.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:13.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:16.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turns out Bartholomew Kuma
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(1622,0,1,\c&H000000&)}was on our side the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:21.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A few days back, when\NI made it to the {\i1}Sunny{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.58,0:13:23.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.31,0:13:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:32.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.66,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell're\Nyou doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:39.10,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.51,0:13:57.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saw for yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:13:59.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there wasn't a single\Nscratch on the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Later, Rayleigh gave\Nme the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:05.73,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I am a member\Nof the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.79,0:14:09.27,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,If it's within my power, I want to help\Nthe Straw Hats escape from here.
Comment: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:09.56,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I want to help the Straw\NHats escape from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:11.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys probably\Nknew that something was up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but now we know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He saved the Sunny,\Nand he saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:21.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then, after we were sent\Nflying from the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma paid Rayleigh a visit\Nand dropped another bombshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:28.05,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,388,1,\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}I don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.05,0:14:29.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Not as myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:33.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The details\Nare a little sketchy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.05,0:14:36.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}but evidently, Kuma surrendered\Nhis body to the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They used him as an experiment {\q2}and\Nreplaced his body parts one by one.
Comment: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}and replaced his body\Nparts one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:42.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the time the War\Nof the Best rolled around,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.89,0:14:45.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,his personality had\Nbeen completely erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.73,0:14:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, he knew where he sent us,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he didn't know what\Nwe'd do once we got there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:52.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or that we would\Neven make it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.74,0:14:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you said his personality\Nwas taken away,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:14:56.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he still\Nprotected the Sunny?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:15:00.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The guy who worked on him\Nis this dude named Dr. Vegapunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.24,0:15:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and Kuma must've\Nmade a deal with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:05.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'cause he programmed one\Nfinal mission into his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:08.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}"Defend the Thousand Sunny\Nfrom any attackers
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}until the moment that a Straw\NHat returns to claim it."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:14.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So even though he's been\Nreduced to a living weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with no memory, he's been\Ncarrying out his own orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Protecting our ship for the past\Ntwo years to fulfill his last wish.
Comment: 0,0:15:20.87,0:15:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to fulfill his last wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:25.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But why? He barely knew us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, why'd it matter to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.51,0:15:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno. Maybe it's\N'cause of Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said Kuma was part\Nof the Revolutionary Army
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:36.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and Luffy's dad's the leader\Nof those guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:37.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:40.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it seems like that robot\Nbear dude was a good guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:43.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so he can't be too bad\Nif they're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:44.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:46.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bottom line is,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:48.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,our survival and all\Nthe things we accomplished
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.69,0:15:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in the past two years,\Nwe owe to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:54.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever his reason was,\Nwe should be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:55.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we may never\Nfind out the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:59.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because it's not like we can ask\Nhim to explain himself anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:02.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we can do now\Nis honor his memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.41,0:16:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and know that Bartholomew\NKuma was our greatest ally
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.74,0:16:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,until he took his last\Nbreath as a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.55,0:16:10.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we'll never\Nbe able to thank him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:13.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since he'll just be a weapon,\Nand likely our enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the next time we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:17.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's all I wanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:19.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Kind of a lot to work through\Nall at once, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:23.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Someday, I hope we can at least\Nfind out the rest of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.03,0:16:25.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma saved us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:26.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:29.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have some lunch!\NIt's from Amazon Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.67,0:16:32.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Amazon Lily.\NThe island with all the women.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.57,0:16:34.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course that's\Nwhere he sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.24,0:16:36.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know where I was\Nthese past two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:39.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I'm kinda thinking Kuma's\Nnot such a good friend after all.
Comment: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:39.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,not such a good\Nfriend after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.51,0:16:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, if he were here right now,\NI'd like to kick his metal face in!
Comment: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd like to kick\Nhis metal face in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.41,0:16:43.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Sanji,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.51,0:16:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we've all had our\Nshare of troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:48.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before I became a pop music\Nsensation, I was trapped in a cage.
Comment: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:48.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was trapped in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:51.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still, the only thing that matters\Nnow is the voyage awaiting us!
Comment: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:51.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is the voyage awaiting us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't know, man!\NYou don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.29,0:16:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead!\NBrother, look! It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.39,0:17:00.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know! Like you said,\Nthey're straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.40,0:17:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think I'm blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.03,0:17:06.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll be sailing\Nwith the Straw Hats after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:08.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow. How far down are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:12.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno, but it's getting\Ndarker and darker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:14.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We passed the photic zone,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:17.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and it looks like we're around\Nthe bottom of the aphotic zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.75,0:17:20.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Bout a thousand meters,\Ngive or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.99,0:17:25.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's quiet. And the Sunny\Nitself feels oddly still.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.39,0:17:28.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's almost like\Nfloating in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:30.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, it's a whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.18,0:17:31.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just like Laboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:34.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nah. It looks\Nmore like Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:39.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec. What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.69,0:17:41.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A fish? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:44.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?\NWe only get one shot at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:46.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:47.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ready, Captain.\N– Ready, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before you say anything,\NI know what you're thinking:
Comment: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:52.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Just shoot them\Nand they'll all drown."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:56.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"They're wanted dead or alive after\Nall, so why not let them die?"
Comment: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:56.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so why not let them die?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:17:58.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that wouldn't do at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.71,0:18:01.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because the Navy wouldn't\Nknow who killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:05.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We have to deliver their heads\Npersonally, on a silver platter!
Comment: 0,0:18:03.71,0:18:05.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on a silver platter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.15,0:18:07.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then they will fear us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The whole world will\Nknow our strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.62,0:18:10.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.99,0:18:13.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll take them out before\Nthey suspect a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.49,0:18:18.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My big, smiling face is the last\Nthing they'll see before they die!
Comment: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:18.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before they die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.16,0:18:19.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes, sir!\N– Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.46,0:18:21.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, right! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a ship-looking\Nthing coming our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?\N– What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.40,0:18:27.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:29.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come\Nlook for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:30.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:41.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're ramming\Nstraight into us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:45.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go away, you morons!\NYou're gonna make us all drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.59,0:18:55.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not trying to break our\Nship, they're trying to board it!
Comment: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:55.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're trying to board it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.27,0:18:57.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:00.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.44,0:19:03.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hard to port, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:11.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attack them, sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:16.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tenacious, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:17.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:19.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They don't know when to quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:22.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are these guys after?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:27.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:29.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bubble's about to pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:31.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:32.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think they want\Nto board the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.57,0:19:35.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sea cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:39.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that noise\Nfrom somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The two bubbles are touching.\NThis is our big moment, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:48.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good! Is everybody ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.25,0:19:49.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momoo, it's me! We've met before!\NYou're from the Arlong Pirates, right?
Comment: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're from the Arlong\NPirates, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.69,0:19:54.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:56.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.12,0:19:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami! I was at Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.33,0:20:04.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy! Doesn't that\Nthing look kinda familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.77,0:20:07.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:12.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:17.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's pay our new friends\Na visit, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.21,0:20:18.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! That guy's up to somethin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay out of our bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess he's lookin'\Nfor a fight, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:32.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no time to waste!\NFollow my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.13,0:20:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:36.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fools! They're\Ncompletely dumbfounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.80,0:20:38.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If they're gonna sit\Nthere catching flies,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.97,0:20:41.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then we'll strike\Nwhile the iron is hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.30,0:20:44.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll smite this entire\Ncrew... right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.71,0:20:47.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For glory!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:50.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:54.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come along, men! We'll make\Nthem beg us for mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?\N– What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.25,0:21:00.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, sea cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:01.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:03.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.02,0:21:05.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We left Captain Caribou\Non that ship back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.23,0:21:07.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.83,0:21:13.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time for a little greeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.57,0:21:18.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire the gatling gun, men!\NShower them in bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:21.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want every last\None of them dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.11,0:21:24.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Send these Straw Hats to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.13,0:21:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.94,0:21:41.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.35,0:21:43.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not going to throw\Nme into the water, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.55,0:21:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't do that to me,\Nmy friend, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:49.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, you're a reasonable\Nfellow, are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:51.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, you're\Nvery good-looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.62,0:21:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure someone\Nlike you understands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the value of human life, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.53,0:21:58.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And besides,\Nthe gods are watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.23,0:22:00.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be judged for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:03.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, make up your\Nfreakin' mind already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.07,0:22:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weren't you just about\Nto fire your gatling gun
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.07,0:22:07.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and blast us all\Nto kingdom come?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.04,0:22:08.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.87,0:22:11.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was just, uh... I was\Njust joking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.88,0:22:13.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't laughin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.31,0:22:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.21,0:22:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you're the captain of that\Nship, but what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.28,0:22:20.05,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Roronoa Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.05,0:22:22.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the world makes you\Nthink I would be the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.89,0:22:26.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm, uh... Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.99,0:22:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those ruffians were keeping me\Nas a... a slave, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:33.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boy! Whew! Glad that's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.42,0:22:34.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, how's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.92,0:22:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think I could stay on this nice\Nship with you all for a little while?
Comment: 0,0:22:36.69,0:22:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with you all for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.52,0:22:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:43.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow. I feel kinda sorry\Nfor this poor loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.36,0:22:45.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's obviously lying!\NAre you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:48.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.56,0:22:49.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.87,0:22:52.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd that giant sea cow\Npulling your ship come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.80,0:22:54.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.21,0:23:00.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my... He-he.\NWho's this vixen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.54,0:23:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I take it you're\Nthe famous cat burglar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.05,0:23:03.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch it, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.81,0:23:04.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody's allowed to drool
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.98,0:23:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,252)}over our beautiful\Nnavigator except for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.08,0:23:11.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NYou're perfectly sa...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.22,0:23:16.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's getting\Nreally old! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.13,0:23:18.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea cow? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.16,0:23:21.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just happened to catch it\Nout in the ocean somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.23,0:23:24.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you're underwater, having\Na sea monster pull your ship
Comment: 0,0:23:22.33,0:23:24.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,having a sea monster\Npull your ship
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.23,0:23:26.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is the mark of an\Nexperienced captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.74,0:23:29.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.41,0:23:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it, sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:34.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.78,0:23:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother! We're on our\Nway to rescue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.81,0:23:42.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna find\Na sea monster, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.12,0:23:45.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What crazy ideas are\Nyou hatching now, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.12,0:23:49.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should try to rehabilitate him\Nwith something a little less sexy.
Comment: 0,0:23:47.65,0:23:49.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with something\Na little less sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.99,0:23:51.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami,\Nthe direction we're taking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.79,0:23:54.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,isn't exactly the same way\NLog Pose is pointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.73,0:23:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.63,0:24:00.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The correct course is technically\Nsouthwest, so we're in the clear.
Comment: 0,0:23:59.06,0:24:00.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we're in the clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.20,0:24:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if we went\Nin a straight line,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.07,0:24:04.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we could get there\Na whole lot faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.37,0:24:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Couldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.07,0:24:06.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, if you go straight,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.17,0:24:09.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you risk getting swept away in a sea\Ncurrent, and if that should happen,
Comment: 0,0:24:08.37,0:24:09.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and if that should happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.81,0:24:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you might run into an underwater\Nmountain or a volcano, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.88,0:24:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.71,0:24:17.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yikes! I'm\Nwith you on this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.05,0:24:19.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I thought all\Nthe currents here were dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.68,0:24:21.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is the Grand Line, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.85,0:24:24.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So are you saying that some\Nof them are actually stable?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, this one is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.52,0:24:29.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That should do it.\NNow you stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.16,0:24:32.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's gonna start getting\Ncolder from here on out
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.16,0:24:34.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so make sure you put\Non a coat or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.16,0:24:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bring up a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.37,0:24:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm already starting to feel\Ngoosebumps on my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.37,0:24:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, except for I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.84,0:24:43.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have any skin\Nbecause you're a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.18,0:24:49.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper... skull jokes\Nare the only thing I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.01,0:24:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't take\Nthat away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.45,0:24:54.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're going somewhere\Ncold? Not the deep sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.55,0:24:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys know the water's\Ncold in the deep sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.45,0:24:58.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just like a bathtub...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.46,0:25:01.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hot water rises and cold\Nsinks to the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.53,0:25:04.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, does it? I don't\Ntake very many baths.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.56,0:25:07.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha! 'Cause heat rises and\Nthere's not much sunlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.87,0:25:10.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so there's nothing to heat\Nthe water down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.27,0:25:14.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The temperature's not the only\Nthing that's different at the bottom.
Comment: 0,0:25:12.04,0:25:14.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that's different at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.07,0:25:16.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not still\Ndepressed, are you?!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:16.31,0:25:20.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Once we move down, we'll find\Nsomething called deep currents.
Dialogue: 3,0:25:20.21,0:25:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You don't run into\Nthem terribly often,
Dialogue: 3,0:25:22.05,0:25:25.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}but they're much larger\Nthan the regular currents.
Dialogue: 3,0:25:25.05,0:25:27.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Also, they're quite unique\Nin that their flow
Dialogue: 3,0:25:27.22,0:25:28.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}is completely independent\Nof what you see
Dialogue: 3,0:25:28.79,0:25:29.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}closer to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.25,0:25:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Currents under the currents and\Nyou even have a diagram, huh?
Comment: 0,0:25:31.32,0:25:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you even have\Na diagram, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.29,0:25:34.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure do know a lot of stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.39,0:25:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's because I'm so old!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.23,0:25:41.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not only that, but all currents\Nare connected to each other.
Comment: 0,0:25:39.20,0:25:41.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but all currents are\Nconnected to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.77,0:25:45.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean they have\Nto flow in the same direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.00,0:25:48.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They flow east,\Nwest, up, and down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.41,0:25:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like a big, long\Ndragon, all tangled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.31,0:25:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The deep currents tend to travel\Nat a surprisingly slow pace.
Comment: 0,0:25:52.78,0:25:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at a surprisingly slow pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.68,0:25:56.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After they reach the deep sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.28,0:25:59.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it takes approximately 2,000 years\Nbefore they finally make their way
Comment: 0,0:25:58.35,0:25:59.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before they finally\Nmake their way
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.85,0:26:01.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,up to the surface of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.82,0:26:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That makes me feel\Nyoung again, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.12,0:26:05.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Two thousand?\N– Two thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.99,0:26:08.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, 2,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.66,0:26:11.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And because of that,\Nthere are countless tales
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.30,0:26:15.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}about what lurks within\Nthose dark deep currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.13,0:26:20.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Monsters. Curses.\NThe wrath of the undead!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.21,0:26:23.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean the deep\Nsea is haunted?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.17,0:26:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? The sea's haunted? Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.48,0:26:26.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds fun to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.98,0:26:28.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calm down, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.85,0:26:31.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about\Nthe wrath of the undead,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.35,0:26:33.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or whatever you're\Nfreaking out about,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.05,0:26:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I do know that we'll encounter\Na downward-flowing current soon.
Comment: 0,0:26:34.38,0:26:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a downward-flowing current soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.15,0:26:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once we do, we should be able\Nto ride it down into the deep sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.97,0:26:43.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– She said something about\N– She said something about
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.47,0:26:45.80,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– deep sea currents, I dunno.\N– deep sea currents, I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.11,0:26:47.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You morons could at least\Npretend like you understand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.22,0:26:51.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shall we sing a duet, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.78,0:26:53.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.23,0:26:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.97,0:27:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, I see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.74,0:27:01.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.90,0:27:03.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.01,0:27:08.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's freakin' sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.61,0:27:10.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Whoa!\N– Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.31,0:27:13.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I admit, whatever that\Nthing is, it's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.78,0:27:17.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This one's called\Nthe Downward Plume.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.59,0:27:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.69,0:27:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's almost like\Na giant waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.70,0:27:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Except underwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.53,0:27:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea is like falling\Ninto the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.40,0:27:35.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which doesn't make\Nsense, but I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.21,0:27:37.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's going so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.96,0:27:41.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mother Nature,\Nyou're one crazy lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.43,0:27:43.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a spectacular sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.43,0:27:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And from the looks of it, I'd\Nsay the stream runs fairly deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.37,0:27:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've heard stories\Nabout these currents,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.20,0:27:50.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but they did not\Ndo them justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.84,0:27:52.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! It's crazy dark down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.77,0:27:54.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The floor's so far,\Nyou can't even see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.87,0:27:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.61,0:27:58.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At this speed, we're\Ngonna get pile-driven
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.14,0:27:59.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,straight down to the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.01,0:28:05.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure it's safe\Nif we just go with the flow?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're worried\Nabout the ship, don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.39,0:28:09.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sunny{\i0} was built\Nfrom the treasure tree Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.96,0:28:12.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's as tough as they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.59,0:28:16.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh? Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.16,0:28:19.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap. So it really\Ndoes live down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.33,0:28:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.24,0:28:24.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A demon that\Nrules over the deep seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.61,0:28:28.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The enemy of all mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.99,0:28:31.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, listen to me, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.19,0:28:34.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to turn back!\NWe're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.73,0:28:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.\NI forgot you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.49,0:28:38.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a sea monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.13,0:28:41.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh... Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.56,0:28:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what is the matter\Nwith you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.63,0:28:45.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh... look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.90,0:28:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.14,0:28:49.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.81,0:28:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. It's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.17,0:29:04.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.11,0:29:09.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The legendary giant\Noctopus monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.45,0:29:12.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He made fish\Nfood outta those ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.32,0:29:15.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They left for the New World\Nand never made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.69,0:29:20.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn around! Please, I'm not\Nready to die! I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.13,0:29:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just wait around for a couple\Ndays and it'll probably go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.63,0:29:26.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut up for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.63,0:29:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just had a perfect idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.67,0:29:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys, we just have\Nto capture it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.71,0:29:34.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=11}===============================DIALOGUE============================
